    {
        "content": "<p><span class=\"user-mention\" data-user-id=\"116846\">@Cameron Freer</span> 's <a href=\"https://github.com/thefundamentaltheor3m/Sphere-Packing-Lean/pull/330\">spherepacking#330</a> is merged, and I'm trying to integrate that into <a href=\"https://github.com/thefundamentaltheor3m/Sphere-Packing-Lean/pull/307\">spherepacking#307</a>. Now I have the following:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">lemma</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">denominator_tendsto_at_infty</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">Tendsto</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"k\">fun</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">↦</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">H₄</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">resToImagAxis</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">re</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">^</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">*</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">*</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">H₄</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">resToImagAxis</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">re</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">^</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">5</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">*</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">H₂</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">resToImagAxis</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">re</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">*</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">H₄</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">resToImagAxis</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">re</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"bp\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">5</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">*</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">H₂</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">resToImagAxis</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">re</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">^</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"o\">))</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">atTop</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">nhds</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">have</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">h₂</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">H₂_re_resToImagAxis_tendsto_zero</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">have</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">h₄</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">H₄_re_resToImagAxis_tendsto_one</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">change</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Tendsto</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"k\">fun</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">↦</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">H₄</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">resToImagAxis</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">re</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">^</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">*</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">*</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">H₄</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">resToImagAxis</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">re</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">^</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">5</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">*</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">H₂</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">resToImagAxis</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">re</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">*</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">H₄</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">resToImagAxis</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">re</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"bp\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">5</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">*</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">H₂</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">resToImagAxis</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">re</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">^</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"o\">))</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">atTop</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">nhds</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">tendsto_cont</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>This works, but without <code>change ...</code>, it doesn't. I don't understand why it is necessary - could anyone help me with this? The tactic state message before/after <code>change</code> looks the same, too.</p>",
