    {
        "content": "<p>What happens if you do a <code>dsimp</code> instead of the <code>change</code>?</p>",
        "id": 580073358,
        "sender_full_name": "Bhavik Mehta",
        "timestamp": 1773794411
    },
    {
        "content": "<p><span class=\"user-mention silent\" data-user-id=\"246273\">Bhavik Mehta</span> <a href=\"#narrow/channel/509682-Sphere-packing-in-8-dimensions/topic/Tendsto/near/580073358\">말함</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>What happens if you do a <code>dsimp</code> instead of the <code>change</code>?</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>It changes from <code>Function.resToImagAxis F ...</code> to <code>ResToImageAxis F ...</code>, but <code>tendsto_cont</code> still cannot finish it (with the same message).</p>",
        "id": 580074711,
        "sender_full_name": "Seewoo Lee",
        "timestamp": 1773795175
    },
    {
        "content": "<p><span class=\"user-mention silent\" data-user-id=\"246273\">Bhavik Mehta</span> <a href=\"#narrow/channel/509682-Sphere-packing-in-8-dimensions/topic/Tendsto/near/580073320\">said</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Maybe this is what the whnfR was for!</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>Yes, that looks correct -- see <a href=\"https://github.com/thefundamentaltheor3m/Sphere-Packing-Lean/pull/367\">spherepacking#367</a>, where I restored that (and changed it further to <code>whnf</code> rather than <code>whnfR</code> to handle <code>def</code> as well as <code>abbrev</code>).</p>\n<p><span class=\"user-mention\" data-user-id=\"588998\">@Seewoo Lee</span> with that PR, this now works for me:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">lemma</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">denominator_tendsto_at_infty</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"n\">Tendsto</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"k\">fun</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">↦</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">H₄</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">resToImagAxis</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">re</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">^</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">*</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">*</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">H₄</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">resToImagAxis</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">re</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">^</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">5</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">*</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">H₂</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">resToImagAxis</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">re</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">*</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">H₄</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">resToImagAxis</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">re</span>\n<span class=\"w\">          </span><span class=\"bp\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">5</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">*</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">H₂</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">resToImagAxis</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">re</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">^</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"o\">))</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">atTop</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">nhds</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">have</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">h₂</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">H₂_re_resToImagAxis_tendsto_zero</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">have</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">h₄</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">H₄_re_resToImagAxis_tendsto_one</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">tendsto_cont</span>\n</code></pre></div>",
        "id": 580093717,
        "sender_full_name": "Cameron Freer",
        "timestamp": 1773804996
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>and I got a <a href=\"https://github.com/thefundamentaltheor3m/Sphere-Packing-Lean/pull/307#issuecomment-4079444377\">few more</a> to work in <a href=\"https://github.com/thefundamentaltheor3m/Sphere-Packing-Lean/pull/307\">spherepacking#307</a></p>",
        "id": 580095622,
